      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write a quick briefing memo for a government official? im looking at the energy transition stuff. basically i need a summary of whether it's better to just push for a super fast phase-out of fossil fuels to hit those decarbonization goals, even if it means energy prices go up and might mess with the economy for a bit. what should the main takeaway be for a leader deciding this?",
